# tests/conformance/effector/listener_step_mask.fixture
# Ref: CE v5.30 p.63, "Effector Listener Step Mask": "If a Listener (or
# Listening/Feeder) step has a Step AMT attribute value of -127 then that
# Listener step will not be influenced by the Feeder."
#
# Track 9 feeds PIT +3. Track 4's step 0 is masked (amt -127) and must show no
# feeder influence; track 0's step 0 is unmasked and must show the full +3.
seed 42
page.tracks 9,4,0 enabled
track 9 role feeder
track 4 role listener
track 0 role listener
track 9 step 0 pit +3
track 4 step 0 amt -127
play 1 step
expect note track=4 pit=+0
expect note track=0 pit=+3
